OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve to hold
OL,4,Adog-friendly bonfire night
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve will host wildlife and
OL,7,Fdog-friendly bonfires with no fireworks
OL,8,Fthis year.
OL,10,FA Bonfire Night event will be held on
OL,11,FThursday at Brockholes on the outskirts
OL,12,Fof Preston in Lancashire.
OL,14,FYasmin Shepherd, from the Lancashire
OL,15,FWildlife Trust, said the bonfire would
OL,16,Fbe built from "wood from around the
OL,17,Fsite that is a conservation by-product
OL,18,Fand would be burnt anyway" and could
OL,19,Fnot be sold as logs.
